  "label": "Camels as visual representation of mocking 'logic'",
  "description": "The visual of three camels with open mouths is mapped onto the textual claim 'muslim \"logic\": pork is unclean.' The camels' shouting-like posture is used as a visual metaphor to represent the absurdity or ridicule of the 'logic' being presented in the text. This mapping is central to the meme's intent, using the camels to visually embody the mockery of the claimed 'logic'.",
